  "id": "therapeutic-window",
  "term": "therapeutic window",
  "definition": "A therapeutic window is the range of treatment conditions, such as dose or timing, in which an intervention produces the desired protective effect while preserving normal function. In this source, it refers to the magnesium concentration and intervention timing that reduce harmful calcium buildup without causing loss of retinal ganglion cell spike output.",
